{
  "method": "Read-only bounded RAM-archive feasibility experiment. Fresh process per read, alternating pair order on repeated cases; current Debug Canon reader library linked to O2 arm64 C++17 diagnostic, Qt6.5.3. Streams the existing complete-field serialization into independent64KiB qCompress level1 blocks; never holds a full uncompressed serialization. Validates SHA256 of concatenated qUncompress bytes and retains projected metadata after graph release.",
