    "Does not implement typed struct restoration or prove pointer-sharing topology. Does not verify sequence resolution after AVB restoration. AVB projection is empty in this diagnostic.",
    "No production code changed. Not a full GUI, full scan, Windows/NEXIS, or300k workload test.",
    "Memory readings are macOS physical footprint and resident peak, not Windows heap. Allocator retention can prevent released graph storage from immediately returning to OS.",
    "Largest single source still parsed as expanded graph; packing adds CPU work. No guaranteed total RAM bound."
